\paragraph{The asymmetry.}
Cross-sample frequency agreement achieves entity-level AUROC${=}0.868$---the only effective entity-level signal---while all three self-verification probes fail.
This asymmetry---strong distributional signal, absent self-judgment capacity---explains why entity-level construction succeeds (\S\ref{sec:prescriptive}) while selection based on self-judgment does not.

